      {/* ── 9. FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS (ACCORDION) ────────────────────────── */}
      <section id="faq" style={{ padding: '80px 24px', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
        <div style={{ maxWidth: '900px', margin: '0 auto' }}>
          <div style={{ textAlign: 'center', marginBottom: '44px' }}>
            <span
              style={{
                background: '#ECFDF5',
                color: '#047857',
                padding: '5px 14px',
                borderRadius: '20px',
                fontSize: '12px',
                fontWeight: 800,
                letterSpacing: '0.5px',
                textTransform: 'uppercase',
                display: 'inline-block',
                marginBottom: '8px',
              }}
            >
              Institutional Clarifications
            </span>
            <h2 style={{ fontSize: '34px', fontWeight: 900, color: '#0F172A' }}>
              Frequently Asked Questions
            </h2>
            <p style={{ fontSize: '16px', color: '#64748B', margin: '8px auto 0' }}>
              Everything you need to know about implementing the Nepal Digital Education Platform in your institution.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: '14px' }}>
            {[
              {
                q: 'Is this platform strictly aligned with the Nepal Curriculum Development Centre (CDC)?',
                a: 'Yes, 100%. All course outlines, subject distributions, credit hours, and textbook materials for Classes 1 through 12 follow the official national curriculum mandated by the Ministry of Education, Science and Technology (MoEST) and the CDC in Sanothimi, Bhaktapur. Both English Medium and Nepali Medium textbooks are pre-loaded.',
              },
              {
                q: 'How does the platform support teachers with low bandwidth or rural connectivity?',
                a: 'The platform features an intelligent offline caching layer. Digital textbooks, downloaded lesson slides, and whiteboard canvas sessions operate without active internet. Student attendance and grades taken offline automatically synchronize with the central cloud database as soon as network connectivity is restored.',
              },
              {
                q: 'What is the difference between a Class Teacher and a Subject Teacher on this platform?',
                a: 'A Subject Teacher only manages the curricula, assignments, and smart board sessions for the specific subjects they are assigned in the timetable. A Class Teacher possesses section-wide supervisory authority, responsible for overall daily attendance roll-call, entering terminal exam marks across all subjects, calculating consolidated GPA, writing conduct remarks, and broadcasting class-level notices.',
              },
              {
                q: 'Can our school import existing student and teacher rosters from Excel / CSV or EMIS?',
                a: 'Yes. School Administrators can import hundreds of students and faculty in seconds using standard CSV templates. Furthermore, the platform matches the CEHRD / IEMIS student ID format, allowing straightforward one-click export for annual government reporting.',
              },
              {
                q: 'How does the AI Assistant maintain a "Zero Hallucination" guarantee?',
                a: 'Unlike generic chatbots, our educational AI is bound by strict curriculum retrieval-augmented boundaries (RAG). It will only formulate explanations, questions, and solutions citing verified page numbers from the official CDC textbooks. If a prompt falls outside the approved syllabus, it explicitly notifies the student rather than guessing.',
              },
              {
                q: 'Can students submit handwritten homework assignments?',
                a: 'Yes. Students can take a photo of their handwritten notebook pages using any smartphone camera or tablet. The system incorporates optical character recognition (OCR) and an 8-step teacher grading studio where educators can annotate directly on the student submission, apply rubric scores, and publish marks instantly.',
              },
            ].map((faq, idx) => {
              const isExpanded = expandedFaq === idx;
              return (
                <div
                  key={idx}
                  style={{
                    border: '1.5px solid #E2E8F0',
                    borderRadius: '12px',
                    overflow: 'hidden',
                    background: isExpanded ? '#F8FAFC' : '#FFFFFF',
                    transition: 'all 0.2s ease',
                  }}
                >
                  <button
                    onClick={() => toggleFaq(idx)}
                    style={{
                      width: '100%',
                      padding: '20px 24px',
                      background: 'none',
                      border: 'none',
                      textAlign: 'left',
                      display: 'flex',
                      alignItems: 'center',
                      justifyContent: 'space-between',
                      cursor: 'pointer',
                      gap: '16px',
                    }}
                  >
                    <span style={{ fontSize: '16px', fontWeight: 800, color: '#0F172A' }}>
                      {faq.q}
                    </span>
                    <div
                      style={{
                        width: '28px',
                        height: '28px',
                        borderRadius: '50%',
                        background: isExpanded ? '#047857' : '#F1F5F9',
                        color: isExpanded ? '#FFFFFF' : '#64748B',
                        display: 'flex',
                        alignItems: 'center',
                        justifyContent: 'center',
                        flexShrink: 0,
                        transition: 'all 0.2s ease',
                      }}
                    >
                      <ChevronDown
                        size={16}
                        style={{
                          transform: isExpanded ? 'rotate(180deg)' : 'rotate(0deg)',
                          transition: 'transform 0.2s ease',
                        }}
                      />
                    </div>
                  </button>
                  {isExpanded && (
                    <div
                      style={{
                        padding: '0 24px 20px',
                        fontSize: '14.5px',
                        color: '#475569',
                        lineHeight: 1.6,
                        borderTop: '1px solid #E2E8F0',
                        paddingTop: '16px',
                      }}
                    >
                      {faq.a}
                    </div>
                  )}
                </div>
              );
            })}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* ── 10. INSTITUTION ONBOARDING BANNER ───────────────────────────────── */}
